      <code>DataSource</code>, and a footer: "Add selected" emits the rows, "create" asks the page.
    </p>

    <app-demo-comp-relation-picker-basic class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-relation-picker-basic>

    <section>
      <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Props, events &amp; parts</h2>
